<title>USA: Timken Co to expand plant by 50 pct.</title>
<headline>Timken Co to expand plant by 50 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW PHILADELPHIA, Ohio 1996-12-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Timken Co said it has broken ground on a $5 million expansion at its New Philadelphia Precision Tapered Bearing Business.</p>
<p>The expansion will increase floor space by 14,000 square feet and boost production capacity of precision tapered bearings, such as those used in specialized printing presses, by 50 percent, Timken said.</p>
</text>
